{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>When he took</b> — Two times in the Masorah: בקחתו את רבקה, בקחתו והוא אסור באזיקים. Regarding Jeremiah: just as 'taking' there means bound, so too here bound — to teach that Isaac too was infertile. And we derive from Manoah: it is written here 'ויעתר יצחק' (Isaac pleaded), and it is written there 'ויעתר מנוח' (Manoah pleaded)." "<b>Laban the Aramean</b> — letters: הרמאי (the deceiver)."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:54.783297481Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}